{"bvid": "BV1fStt6SEe4", "title": "英语自学方法锐评｜i+1的巨大陷阱｜影子跟读不要练", "duration": 608, "subs": [{"cid": 41454732886, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 248, "body": [{"from": 0.0, "to": 3.92, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "今天来锐评一下各种常见的英语自学方法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.92, "to": 5.04, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "先叠个甲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 5.04, "to": 7.32, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "本视频没有严谨的评判标准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 10.93, "to": 15.18, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "主播从大学开学自学英语六级596", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 15.18, "to": 17.02, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "雅思总分7.5", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.02, "to": 19.18, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "成绩不算什么英语大神", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 19.18, "to": 21.76, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "但这些年确实试过不少方法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 21.76, "to": 23.48, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "也踩过不少坑", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.48, "to": 27.56, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "所以这一期就根据主播自己的实际体验", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 27.56, "to": 31.54, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "主观评价一下我亲身尝试过的英语学习方法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.54, "to": 33.56, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "我们正式开始", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 34.35, "to": 36.47, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "第一个要评价的是听力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 36.47, "to": 37.25, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "磨耳朵", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.25, "to": 40.97, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "所谓磨耳朵就是找一段TED演讲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 40.97, "to": 42.93, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "播客或者英文新闻", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.93, "to": 44.11, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "走路经", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 44.11, "to": 45.41, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "坐车听", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 45.41, "to": 46.53, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "吃饭听", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 46.53, "to": 48.89, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "睡觉前还要听反复", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 48.89, "to": 50.81, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "只要泡在英文环境里