 "那就大可不必综合评价HPC", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 197.6, "to": 200.06, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "下面简单评价一下背单词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 200.06, "to": 201.92, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "借用某位于啤酒的一句话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 201.92, "to": 206.04, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "问背单词是典型的懦夫行为", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 206.04, "to": 207.34, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "这句话准不准确", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 207.34, "to": 208.26, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "暂且不说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 208.26, "to": 209.86, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "节目效果确实非常", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 209.86, "to": 213.76, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "顶级主播并不认为单词完全不需要背", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 213.76, "to": 214.62, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "背单词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 214.62, "to": 216.93, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "在两个场景里有它的效果", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 217.25, "to": 220.43, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "第一您目前的词汇量确实很低", "music": 0.0841121456022388}, {"from": 220.43, "to": 223.8, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "已经明显低于你准备参加的英语考试要求", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 226.78, "to": 228.58, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "在你眼里就不是文章", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 228.58, "to": 229.88, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "而写二维码", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 229.88, "to": 232.64, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "第二考试下个月就到了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 232.64, "to": 235.81, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "明旭抱抱佛脚总比摆烂强", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 235.81, "to": 237.69, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "但除开这两种情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 237.69, "to": 239.61, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "单纯依赖单词软件", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 239.61, "to": 241.45, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "一天刷几十个词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 241.45, "to": 243.56, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "通常是一种效率不高", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 243.56, "to": 246.23, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "却特别容易计较进步感的方法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 246.23, "to": 247.91, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "打卡300天", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 247.91, "to": 250.39, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "软件里的联系记录非常漂亮", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 250.39, "to": 252.49, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "真正阅读里碰到的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 252.49, "to": 254.94, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "或者是写作又要用到的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 254.94, "to": 256.94, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "大脑还是一片空白", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 256.94, "to": 262.35, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "背单词最大的问题不是背好写机背哎", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 262.35, "to": 265.01, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "古力记住一个中文血印", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 265.01, "to": 267.03, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "和你能在阅读里认出来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 267.03, "to": 268.99, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "在听地里反应过来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 268.99, "to": 272.91, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "在写作时主动用出来是四件不同的事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 272.91, "to": 274.99, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "所以词汇量太低", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 274.99, "to": 279.19, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "或者临近考试时背单词可以搞一搞", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 279.19, "to": 281.63, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "但作为日常学习的主线任务", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 281.63, "to": 283.64, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "性价比就比较一般", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 283.64, "to": 287.88, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "这里根据不同情况给到NPC和人上人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 288.59, "to": 290.49, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "下面讨论影子跟读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 290.49, "to": 291.87, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "先说结论", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 291.87, "to": 294.17, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "对于大部分普通英语学习者", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 294.17, "to": 295.95, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "影子跟读基本没用", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 295.95, "to": 297.659, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "所谓影子跟读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 297.659, "to": 299.379, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "这些音频播放以后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 299.379, "to": 301.959, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "像影子一样连续重复演讲者的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 301.959, "to": 304.48, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "这个方法看起来非常全面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 304.76, "to": 308.19, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "听弟念的口语练嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 308.19, "to": 309.41, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "发音练了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 309.41, "to": 311.33, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "反音速度好像也练了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 311.33, "to": 314.64, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "但他的问题恰恰是什么都想练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 314.64, "to": 316.82, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "最后什么都练得不够精准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 316.82, "to": 318.9, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "如果目的是练语音语调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 318.9, "to": 320.58, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "为什么不嫌短劲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 320.58, "to": 321.95, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "仔细模仿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 321.95, "to": 323.419, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "在录音对敌", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 323.419, "to": 325.599, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "如果目的是练口语表达", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 325.599, "to": 327.439, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "为什么不直接复述", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 327.439, "to": 331.549, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "或者跟阿雅外教和语言伙伴对话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 331.549, "to": 333.269, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "如果莫迪训练经历", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 333.269, "to": 337.309, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "为什么不经听定位自己到底漏掉了哪些声音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 337.309, "to": 339.569, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "影子跟读特别耗费注意力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 339.569, "to": 341.089, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "而且非常枯燥", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 341.089, "to": 342.94, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "能顺利跟下来的人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 342.94, "to": 345.82, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "往往已经具备不错的听力和口语基础", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 345.82, "to": 347.18, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "最需要提高基础", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 347.18, "to": 350.48, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "英语的人又经常连连记都没听清", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 350.48, "to": 353.929, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "节能跟在后面念一腔意义不明的声音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 353.929, "to": 356.829, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "最危险的地方在于它很累", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 356.829, "to": 358.609, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "所以会让你产生一种", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 358.609, "to": 361.049, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "今天念得非常加戏的满足感", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 361.049, "to": 362.929, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "至于到底提升了什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 362.929, "to": 364.029, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "不知道", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 364.029, "to": 365.769, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "反正先定了再说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 365.769, "to": 368.63, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "综合评价拉完了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 370.39, "to": 373.21, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "接下来是重量级选手嗨加一", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 373.21, "to": 374.31, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "简单来说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 374.31, "to": 377.79, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "他强调的是先行者接触的语言材料", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 377.79, "to": 379.7, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "应该大体能够理解", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 379.7, "to": 382.28, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "同时又比目前的血瓶稍微难一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 382.28, "to": 385.189, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "这个稍微难一点就是加一", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 385.189, "to": 387.929, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "他最容易被包装成一句非常诱人的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 387.929, "to": 390.149, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "只要找到适合自己的内容", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 390.149, "to": 391.649, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "坚持大量修路", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 391.649, "to": 393.01, "sid": 163, "location": 2, "content": "不背语法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 393.01, "to": 396.85, "sid": 164, "location": 2, "content": "不刻意练习英语水平就会自己长出来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 396.85, "to": 399.2, "sid": 165, "location": 2, "content": "这个理论本身很有价值", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 399.2, "to": 401.56, "sid": 166, "location": 2, "content": "但它最大的陷阱是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 401.56, "to": 404.62, "sid": 167, "location": 2, "content": "实践起来远没有一句多读多听那么简单", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 404.62, "to": 407.4, "sid": 168, "location": 2, "content": "首先学习周期很长", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 407.4, "to": 409.42, "sid": 169, "location": 2, "content": "它更像漫漫滚雪球", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 409.42, "to": 411.04, "sid": 170, "location": 2, "content": "通常要按月献祭", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 411.04, "to": 412.32, "sid": 171, "location": 2, "content": "按年来看效果", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 412.32, "to": 414.58, "sid": 172, "location": 2, "content": "如果你下周就要考雅思", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 414.58, "to": 417.4, "sid": 173, "location": 2, "content": "这个时候再开始执行I加一", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 417.4, "to": 419.6, "sid": 174, "location": 2, "content": "多少有点像明天交房租", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 419.6, "to": 421.96, "sid": 175, "location": 2, "content": "今天开始研究价值投资", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 421.96, "to": 426.06, "sid": 176, "location": 2, "content": "其次你很难找到一份同时满足三个条件的材料", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 426.06, "to": 428.54, "sid": 177, "location": 2, "content": "难度刚好内容有趣", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 428.54, "to": 430.27, "sid": 178, "location": 2, "content": "内容量还足够多", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 430.27, "to": 433.39, "sid": 179, "location": 2, "content": "英语水平一般的时候适合你的可能性", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 433.39, "to": 434.27, "sid": 180, "location": 2, "content": "分级读物", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 434.27, "to": 437.25, "sid": 181, "location": 2, "content": "青少年小说或者比较简单的视频", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 437.25, "to": 438.97, "sid": 182, "location": 2, "content": "但适合你的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 438.97, "to": 442.26, "sid": 183, "location": 2, "content": "你不一定想看你真正想看的东西", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 442.26, "to": 444.34, "sid": 184, "location": 2, "content": "又可能每页20个生词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 444.34, "to": 449.14, "sid": 185, "location": 2, "content": "最后输入并不等于输出大量阅读和听力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 449.14, "to": 450.97, "sid": 186, "location": 2, "content": "可以给你积累词汇", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 450.97, "to": 452.78, "sid": 187, "location": 2, "content": "语感和表达素材", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 452.78, "to": 456.44, "sid": 188, "location": 2, "content": "但如果你的目标包括流利口语和写作能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 456.44, "to": 458.98, "sid": 189, "location": 2, "content": "通常仍然需要大量的语法学习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 458.98, "to": 461.71, "sid": 190, "location": 2, "content": "写作练习和真实的口语交流", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 461.71, "to": 464.43, "sid": 191, "location": 2, "content": "很多爱加一的成功案例", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 464.43, "to": 467.36, "sid": 192, "location": 2, "content": "同时还拥有完备的语法学习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 467.36, "to": 468.88, "sid": 193, "location": 2, "content": "大量的修修练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 468.88, "to": 470.97, "sid": 194, "location": 2, "content": "以及叶强英语交流环境", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 470.97, "to": 473.19, "sid": 195, "location": 2, "content": "只看到大量阅读这一个环节", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 473.19, "to": 475.31, "sid": 196, "location": 2, "content": "就把其他条件全部删掉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 475.31, "to": 478.25, "sid": 197, "location": 2, "content": "会对效果产生不现实的期待", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 478.57, "to": 481.03, "sid": 198, "location": 2, "content": "不过修了这么多不足", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 481.03, "to": 484.55, "sid": 199, "location": 2, "content": "主播依然认为哀嘉怡是一个非常有用的方法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 484.55, "to": 488.38, "sid": 200, "location": 2, "content": "他至少抓住了语言学习里最重要的东西之一", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 488.38, "to": 490.44, "sid": 201, "location": 2, "content": "漂亮可理解", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 490.44, "to": 492.66, "sid": 202, "location": 2, "content": "能长期坚持的珍惜输入", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 492.66, "to": 494.1, "sid": 203, "location": 2, "content": "只要别把它当成", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 494.1, "to": 496.539, "sid": 204, "location": 2, "content": "完全不需要输出的英语学习捷径", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 496.539, "to": 498.619, "sid": 205, "location": 2, "content": "也别期待30天速成", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 498.619, "to": 500.119, "sid": 206, "location": 2, "content": "他依然很强", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 500.119, "to": 502.359, "sid": 207, "location": 2, "content": "综合评价顶级", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 502.359, "to": 504.53, "sid": 208, "location": 2, "content": "下面是一个不算轻松", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 504.53, "to": 506.57, "sid": 209, "location": 2, "content": "但确实很有用的方法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 506.57, "to": 511.48, "sid": 210, "location": 2, "content": "回忆简单来说就是先有一份中英文对照的材料", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 511.48, "to": 513.2, "sid": 211, "location": 2, "content": "自己尝试只看中文", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 513.2, "to": 515.02, "sid": 212, "location": 2, "content": "把它翻译成英文原文", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 515.02, "to": 518.01, "sid": 213, "location": 2, "content": "然后再和原来的英文版本进行对比", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 518.01, "to": 522.25, "sid": 214, "location": 2, "content": "回忆最大的优点是他能能够非常残忍的积蓄", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 522.25, "to": 524.11, "sid": 215, "location": 2, "content": "你以为自己会的英语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 524.11, "to": 526.61, "sid": 216, "location": 2, "content": "和你真正能修出出来的英语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 526.61, "to": 528.83, "sid": 217, "location": 2, "content": "中间可能隔着一个太平洋", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 528.83, "to": 530.75, "sid": 218, "location": 2, "content": "阅读英文言文的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 530.75, "to": 532.27, "sid": 219, "location": 2, "content": "每句话都认写", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 532.27, "to": 533.99, "sid": 220, "location": 2, "content": "感觉理解起来不难", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 533.99, "to": 536.11, "sid": 221, "location": 2, "content": "但当你把言文盖住以后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 536.11, "to": 537.69, "sid": 222, "location": 2, "content": "轮到自己复述", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 537.69, "to": 539.569, "sid": 223, "location": 2, "content": "就开始抓耳挠腮", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 539.569, "to": 540.829, "sid": 224, "location": 2, "content": "通过对比", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 540.829, "to": 545.189, "sid": 225, "location": 2, "content": "你会很快发现自己的积极问题是词汇想不起来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 545.189, "to": 546.93, "sid": 226, "location": 2, "content": "是搭配不自然", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 546.93, "to": 548.57, "sid": 227, "location": 2, "content": "是器形态单一", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 548.57, "to": 550.51, "sid": 228, "location": 2, "content": "韩信明明知道意思", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 550.51, "to": 552.71, "sid": 229, "location": 2, "content": "却只会用中文逻辑硬拼", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 552.71, "to": 555.71, "sid": 230, "location": 2, "content": "它能最大程度地暴露自学语法的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 555.71, "to": 558.51, "sid": 231, "location": 2, "content": "特别能提升写作和表达的准确性", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 558.51, "to": 560.75, "sid": 232, "location": 2, "content": "回忆最大的难点是非常内", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 560.75, "to": 562.079, "sid": 233, "location": 2, "content": "速度也很慢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 562.079, "to": 563.799, "sid": 234, "location": 2, "content": "做起来非常痛苦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 563.799, "to": 566.579, "sid": 235, "location": 2, "content": "但喜能带来的吉香也是十分可观的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 566.579, "to": 571.81, "sid": 236, "location": 2, "content": "综合评价顶级本视频就先评价这么多", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 571.81, "to": 573.19, "sid": 237, "location": 2, "content": "最后强调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 573.19, "to": 576.51, "sid": 238, "location": 2, "content": "这份排名及代表主播自己的经历和偏见", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 576.51, "to": 579.079, "sid": 239, "location": 2, "content": "不是什么英语学习终极真理", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 579.079, "to": 582.64, "sid": 240, "location": 2, "content": "同一种方法放在不同水瓶哼", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 582.779, "to": 586.5, "sid": 241, "location": 2, "content": "不同目标的人先下效果可能不一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 586.5, "to": 590.64, "sid": 242, "location": 2, "content": "真正重要的不是找到一个听起来最先进的方法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 590.64, "to": 593.79, "sid": 243, "location": 2, "content": "而是真正花时间和精力去学英语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 593.79, "to": 596.55, "sid": 244, "location": 2, "content": "没学好的主要原因是你根本就没努力学", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 596.55, "to": 599.13, "sid": 245, "location": 2, "content": "而不是学习方法不够先进", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 599.13, "to": 601.91, "sid": 246, "location": 2, "content": "如果对视频有不同意见或者建议", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 601.91, "to": 603.95, "sid": 247, "location": 2, "content": "欢迎评论区友好讨论", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 603.95, "to": 605.36, "sid": 248, "location": 2, "content": "感谢观看", "music": 0.0}]}]}